  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F.",
    "Rinse the fish and pat dry with paper towels.",
    "Mix sesame seeds, citrus zest, soy sauce, coconut sugar, and fish fillets in a bowl.",
    "Heat vegetable oil in a lidded Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add garlic and ginger to the pot and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the fish mixture to the pot and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in kombu extract and lime juice.",
    "Cover the pot and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Bake for 10-12 minutes or until the fish flakes easily with a fork.",
    "Check for doneness and season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
